{
  "status": "applied",
  "key": "thumbnail_format",
  "value": "webp",
  "rationale": "WebP produces the smallest thumbnails at 20 KB — 33% smaller than JPEG (30 KB) and 75% smaller than PNG (80 KB). Current test evidence confirms that all target browsers and the deployed image pipeline pass WebP compatibility tests, making it both the most space-efficient and fully supported choice for web thumbnails."
}
